BiHOI Pipeline — license overview

This folder is a source aggregation. It is not relicensed under a single license,
and no blanket commercial-use or redistribution permission is granted. Any license
at the root of the DONIC repository does not apply to the third-party parts below.

1. Code written for this pipeline

   Copyright (c) 2026 Ropedia.
   Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International
   License (CC BY-NC 4.0); full text in licenses/CC-BY-NC-4.0.txt and at
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

   This covers:
   - webui/, scripts/, tests/, configs/ (except configs/models/)
   - web_demos/ (except web_demos/third_party/)
   - run_hand_calibration_args.sh and the top-level documentation
   - the pipeline scripts we added under pipeline/ (for example the stage
     wrappers pipeline/*.sh and the export, rendering and post-optimization
     scripts in pipeline/FoundationPose/). Files under pipeline/FoundationPose/
     are additionally subject to NVIDIA's FoundationPose license (item 2).

2. Third-party code (vendored or modified)

   Each component keeps its own license and copyright notices, mapped in
   THIRD_PARTY.md with full texts in licenses/:
   - Original EasyMocap code and modifications remain subject to licenses/EasyMocap.txt
     (non-commercial).
   - FoundationPose code is subject to NVIDIA's non-commercial license
     (pipeline/FoundationPose/LICENSE).
   - SAM3 and SAM3D use their supplied custom licenses; SAM2 and Depth Anything 3
     code are Apache-2.0; FMHR is Apache-2.0.
   - The modified WAPR core is LGPL-2.1-only; see web_demos/third_party/WAPR/LICENSE
     and LOCAL_CHANGES.md.

3. Not distributed here

   - WiLoR-modified code (CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0). It requires a separate licensed local import.
   - HO-Cap is installed externally under its upstream license; its source license
     file says AGPL-3.0.
   - Model weights, MANO assets, measured camera calibration and datasets. Their
     separate licenses still apply.
